        "native": "\u00c0 l\u2019heure du d\u00e9part pour la grande migration, Darius, le doyen de la vol\u00e9e, est bless\u00e9. Il va devoir confier tous ses secrets et le nouvel itin\u00e9raire du voyage au premier oiseau venu. Et cet oiseau\u2026 c\u2019est notre h\u00e9ros, exalt\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019id\u00e9e de d\u00e9couvrir enfin le monde\u2026 mais pas du tout migrateur !",
        "english": "When about to set off on the great migration, Darius, the oldest member and leader of the flock, is injured. He must confide all his secrets and the new itinerary to the first bird that comes along. And this bird... is our hero, thrilled by the idea of at last discovering the world... but not all a migratory one!"
